.png", "id": "1142952768527829", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654944867_1142952771861162_7313926769713827768_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oqYv5gViphoQ7kNvwFflSNM&_nc_oc=AdrfNo5sR82rsCHX9BsIpJdNsoNnnXXXT_WDuO2T58NYqOURpL3hBc_MduIwZQ-ylfE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQiGmGAv-pLnhef02KpNcxbfszqZEVuz3NRt9Rze1iuLA&oe=6B0D9DDB"}, "display_name": "Mysterious Cave", "keywords": ["arcade", "missions", "immersive", "obstacle", "runner"], "long_description": "# Mysterious Cave \u2013 Endless Runner\n\nEnter Mysterious Cave, an action-packed VR endless runner where quick reflexes, smart timing, and power-ups help you survive the depths of a mysterious underground world. Dodge obstacles, jump over hazards, collect points, and push your limits as the challenge gets harder with every level.\n\n## RUN, DODGE & SURVIVE\nRace through a winding cave filled with dangerous obstacles. Stay alert, react quickly, and master your movements to keep your run going. As the difficulty increases, every decision matters. How far can you go?\n\n## COLLECT POWER-UPS\nDiscover powerful abilities that can help you during your run:\n\n- **SHIELD:** Gain protection as you navigate dangerous obstacles.\n- **SLOW MOTION:** Slow down the action to help you react to challenging situations.\n- **COLLECT POINTS:** Gather points scattered throughout your run and aim to collect as many as possible.\n\nUse your abilities wisely, time your moves, and make every run count!\n\n## COMPLETE MISSIONS & UNLOCK NEW THEMES\nTake on missions, earn rewards, and unlock different cave themes as you progress. Face increasingly difficult levels, overcome tougher obstacles, and experience new visual environments as your adventure continues.\n\n## CHALLENGE YOUR REFLEXES\nEvery run tests your timing, reactions, and ability to handle unexpected obstacles. Improve your skills, collect more points, master your power-ups, and see how far you can survive in this fast-paced virtual reality arcade adventure.\n\n", "short_description": "Enter Mysterious Cave, a VR endless runner for Meta Quest! Run through a mysterious cave, dodge obstacles, jump over hazards, and complete missions as the challenge gets harder. Collect rewards and unlock new cave themes as you progress through increasingly difficult levels. Test your reflexes, master your timing, and push your limits in this fast-paced virtual reality running game. Every run challenges you to survive longer, overcome tougher obstacles, and discover what awaits deeper inside the"}]}, "developer_name": "Issac Nabil", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://myspace.royalwebhosting.net/mysterious_cave_vr.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Logix Tech", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://logixteck.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1416474944882297"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1652866862909496"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4515750598753298"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1652866862909496"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1793850120, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1652866862909496"}]}, 